* The Tree Grows Asymmetrically

::: columns
:::: {.column width=45%}
- @Properties@: after many iterations the tree is far from uniform
  - The principal variation is deep and narrow
  - Refuted lines keep one or two visits and are never expanded again
  - The visit counts at the root become the real output of the search

- @Key idea@: the shape of the tree _is_ the allocation of the budget
::::
:::: {.column width=55%}

